        <h2>Summary: Your Options in 2026</h2>

        <p><strong>Best for convenience:</strong> R-kioski. Reliable stock, nationwide presence, no planning required.</p>

        <p><strong>Best for selection & price:</strong> Cross-border shopping in Estonia (ferry) or Sweden. Requires planning but significantly cheaper and offers more flavors.</p>

        <p><strong>Not an option:</strong> Online ordering to Finland. Accept this and plan accordingly.</p>

        <p>Finland's regulatory environment has tightened, but nicotine pouches remain legal and accessible. The shift from "buy online whenever" to "physical retail only" is real, but for most users, visiting a local R-kioski remains simple and hassle-free. For those seeking better prices or variety, the nearby Nordic countries are just a ferry ride away.</p>

